---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Founder – Shakarganj Foundation"
  description="Read about Mian Altaf M. Saleem, Founder of Shakarganj Foundation, former Federal Minister for Privatisation, and industrial leader of Pakistan."
>
  <!-- Standard Top Page Hero Banner -->
  <section class="page_hero_banner">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero_breadcrumbs">
        <a href="/">Home</a> <span>›</span>
        <a href="/about-us/">About Us</a> <span>›</span>
        <span class="current">Founder</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="hero_page_title">Founder</h1>
      <p class="hero_subtitle">Honoring the vision, leadership, and enduring industrial and philanthropic legacy of Mian Altaf M. Saleem.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Top Action Bar -->
  <section class="top-action-bar">
    <div class="container action-container">
      <a href="/donate-now/" class="btn btn-donate">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="6" width="20" height="12" rx="2"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/><path d="M6 12h.01M18 12h.01"/></svg>
        DONATE NOW
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Founder Profile Section -->
  <section class="founder-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="founder-grid">
        
        <!-- Left Column: Portrait & Highlights -->
        <div class="founder-card-wrapper">
          <div class="card founder-portrait-card">
            <div class="image-box">
              <img 
                src="https://docs.sf.org.pk/images/founder_mian_altaf.png" 
                alt="Mian Altaf M. Saleem" 
                loading="eager"
                onerror="this.src='/images/founder_mian_altaf.png'"
              />
            </div>
            <div class="portrait-info">
              <h3>Mian Altaf M. Saleem</h3>
              <p class="role-badge">Founder & Former Chief Executive Officer</p>
              
              <div class="key-milestones">
                <div class="milestone">
                  <span class="m-icon">📅</span>
                  <span>Joined Shakarganj in <strong>1973</strong></span>
                </div>
                <div class="milestone">
                  <span class="m-icon">👔</span>
                  <span>Appointed CEO in <strong>1978</strong></span>
                </div>
                <div class="milestone">
                  <span class="m-icon">🏛️</span>
                  <span>Federal Minister for Privatisation (<strong>1999</strong>)</span>
                </div>
                <div class="milestone">
                  <span class="m-icon">🇨🇦</span>
                  <span>Honorary Consul General of Canada</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right Column: Detailed Biography -->
        <div class="bio-content-column">
          <span class="badge badge-primary">FOUNDER'S PROFILE</span>
          <h2 class="bio-name"><span class="highlight-gold">Mian Altaf M. Saleem</span></h2>
          <p class="bio-tagline">Architect of Industrial Innovation & Visionary Social Philanthropy</p>
          
          <div class="bio-paragraphs">
            <p>
              Mian Altaf M. Saleem joined Shakarganj in 1973, during the establishment of our first sugar factory. First working under the able guidance of our first Chief Executive Officer, Haji Muhammad Shafi, and later succeeding him as CEO in November 1978, Mian Altaf M. Saleem oversaw the transformation of Shakarganj from a minor player in the sugar industry to a major industrial conglomerate, one of the top companies in the stock exchange, and a household name in Pakistan.
            </p>
            <p>
              Mian Altaf M. Saleem led Shakarganj for over 21 years, during which the Company expanded into the production of Biofuels, Building Materials, and Textiles as well as becoming one of the first Sugar Mills to supply power to the national grid through co-generation. During this period, Mian Altaf M. Saleem also served in several key positions outside of Shakarganj, including three terms as Chairman of the Pakistan Sugar Mills Association and as Honorary Consul General of Canada.
            </p>
            <p>
              Mian Altaf M. Saleem retired as Chief Executive Officer when invited to lead the Privatisation programme of the Government of Pakistan in 1999. As the Federal Minister for Privatisation, Mian Altaf M. Saleem was a member of the Federal Government’s Economic Management Team and served on important cabinet committees such as the Economic Coordination Committee, and Cabinet Committees on Housing, Investment, Privatization and Revenue. He also chaired the Joint Ministerial Commissions with Azerbaijan, Kazakhstan, and Tunisia.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Legacy Cards -->
      <div class="legacy-section">
        <h3 class="legacy-title">Key Pillars of Leadership & Service</h3>
        <div class="grid-3">
          <div class="card legacy-card">
            <div class="card-body">
              <span class="legacy-icon">🏭</span>
              <h4>Industrial Transformation</h4>
              <p>Pioneered diversification into Biofuels, Textiles, Building Materials, and pioneering national grid co-generation power in Pakistan.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card legacy-card">
            <div class="card-body">
              <span class="legacy-icon">🏛️</span>
              <h4>National Economic Leadership</h4>
              <p>Served as Federal Minister for Privatisation and key member of Pakistan's Economic Coordination & Management Committees.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card legacy-card">
            <div class="card-body">
              <span class="legacy-icon">🤝</span>
              <h4>Philanthropic Vision</h4>
              <p>Founded Shakarganj Foundation to uplift rural Punjab through free schools, medical dispensaries, and cultural heritage promotion.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    /* Top Action Bar */
    .top-action-bar {
      padding: 16px 0;
      background: var(--bg-white);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    }
    .action-container {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: flex-end;
    }
    .btn-donate {
      background: transparent;
      border: 2px solid var(--accent-gold);
      color: #b36b00;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      transition: var(--transition-fast);
    }
    .btn-donate:hover {
      background: var(--accent-gold);
      color: #000000;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(255, 167, 53, 0.3);
    }

    /* Founder Section */
    .founder-section {
      padding: 50px 0 70px;
      background: var(--bg-white);
    }
    .founder-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 320px 1fr;
      gap: 45px;
      margin-bottom: 60px;
    }
    .founder-portrait-card {
      border-top: 5px solid var(--primary-color);
      background: var(--bg-light);
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }
    .image-box {
      background: #ffffff;
      padding: 15px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    }
    .image-box img {
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      max-height: 360px;
      object-fit: contain;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }
    .portrait-info {
      padding: 20px 18px;
    }
    .portrait-info h3 {
      font-size: 20px;
      color: var(--primary-dark);
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .role-badge {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--primary-color);
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }
    .key-milestones {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 10px;
      text-align: left;
      border-top: 1px stroke var(--border-light);
      padding-top: 15px;
    }
    .milestone {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      font-size: 13.5px;
      color: var(--text-dark);
    }
    .m-icon {
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    /* Bio Column */
    .bio-name {
      font-size: 32px;
      margin: 12px 0 6px;
    }
    .highlight-gold {
      color: #ff9c1e;
    }
    .bio-tagline {
      font-size: 16.5px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }
    .bio-paragraphs p {
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      text-align: justify;
    }

    /* Legacy Section */
    .legacy-section {
      background: var(--bg-light);
      padding: 40px 30px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    }
    .legacy-title {
      font-size: 24px;
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--primary-dark);
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }
    .legacy-card {
      border-top: 4px solid var(--accent-gold);
      height: 100%;
      transition: var(--transition-fast);
    }
    .legacy-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    }
    .legacy-icon {
      font-size: 28px;
      background: rgba(0, 77, 0, 0.08);
      width: 52px;
      height: 52px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }
    .legacy-card h4 {
      font-size: 18px;
      color: var(--primary-dark);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .legacy-card p {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin: 0;
    }

    /* Responsive */
    @media (max-width: 992px) {
      .founder-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      .image-box img {
        height: auto;
        max-height: 380px;
        max-width: 300px;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }
    }
  </style>
</Layout>
